 "title": "Ash Kalra",
 "intro": "Report an officeholder change\nAsh Kalra (Democratic Party) is a member of the California State Assembly, representing District 25. He assumed office on December 5, 2022. His current term ends on December 7, 2026.\nKalra (Democratic Party) is running for re-election to the California State Assembly to represent District 25. He is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026. He advanced from the primary on June 2, 2026.",
